{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31734","headline":"延寿里精舍寓居 · 贾岛","name":"延寿里精舍寓居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅托避华馆，荒楼遂愚慵。\n短庭无繁植，珍果春亦浓。\n侧庐废扃枢，纤魄时卧逢。\n耳目乃鄽井，肺肝即岩峰。\n汲泉饮酌余，见我闲静容。\n霜蹊犹舒英，寒蝶断来踪。\n双履与谁逐，一寻青瘦筇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}